  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Look at existing standards around workflow (see Sandy's ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "bibliography). Also look at Eden Workflow engine. ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Specify somthing that is generalizable and configurable, ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "so that we do not hard wire any one workflow into ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fedora.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Date: 2005-03-24 14:52",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sender: payette",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Logged In: YES ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "user_id=128",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Can we integrate an existing workflow engine into the ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fedora Service Framework.  This is beyond the simple ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "submit/review/edit workflow tracking (that we will ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "implement as a simple workflow service to support Fedora-",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "IR.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Date: 2005-02-02 11:29",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sender: payette",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Logged In: YES ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "user_id=128",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "This may be done in cooperation with Fedora Development ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Consortium members.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Do we need a Fedora Workflow API?",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Will this be done as a service layer on top of Fedora?",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "bulletList"
    }
   ],
